    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people like to write something on the books they read. But perhaps a few will leave "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "visible"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " marks on them. "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "recent"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", such marks were found in an ancient book."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Scientists used a new technology to study "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "artifacts",
            "ref": "v-artifact"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Bodleian Library",
            "zh": "博德莱安图书馆"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in England. They "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "3D-scanned",
            "zh": "三维扫描"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the artifacts to find "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "hide"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " information in them. One of the artifacts was a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "manuscript",
            "ref": "v-manuscript"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "biblical text",
            "zh": "《圣经》文本"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It was produced in England in the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "eight"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " century. In it, scientists found some marks. A lady named Eadburg may have "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "leave"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " these marks."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This lady used the dry point of a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "quill",
            "zh": "羽毛笔"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", without ink, to write these marks. Her name, “EADBURG”, is "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "write"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in full five times in the manuscript. It appears "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "other"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " ten times in short forms. They include “E”, “EAD” and “EADB”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The marks also include some simple drawings of human figures. One of the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "draw"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " has two people in it. The one on the left raises his left hand. And the other man on the right holds out his arms."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "At that time, a woman was among the most educated in society if she could read and write. So who was this “Eadburg”? Scientists have a list of nine possible women. But they haven’t gotten the answer yet."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Scientists will study the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "signatures",
            "ref": "v-signature"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and the drawings "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "far"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the coming months. “The answer "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10,
            "hint": {
              "baseWord": "lie"
            }
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in this manuscript,” said one scientist. “It speaks across the centuries.”"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
